WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.473
Learn to determine set of factors of a given numbers up to 50 and determine the

00:00:05.473 --> 00:00:09.757
highest common factor (hcf) of any two whole numbers between 1 and 50

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:16.368
27 objects are put into groups of 9. How many groups are made? The answer is 3.

00:00:16.368 --> 00:00:17.721
Factors make equal groups.

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:23.881
A gardener plants 18 seedlings in equal rows of 9. How many complete rows are needed?

00:00:23.881 --> 00:00:26.555
Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:27.367 --> 00:00:31.036
The answer is 2. 18 divided by 9 equals 2.
